### ==============================================================================
### Klik Indomaret - REST Client Request Collection (requests.http)
### Dapat dijalankan langsung dari VS Code (REST Client Extension) atau IntelliJ IDEA
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### 1. Autentikasi (Login Admin)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Simpan token dari response login
@authToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}

### 2. Autentikasi (Login Staff)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "staff",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Pencarian Toko (Search Stores by Province with Whitelist Priority & Created Date Sort)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stores/search?province=Jawa+Barat&page=0&size=10&sortDirection=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Detail Toko by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/stores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Daftar Kantor Cabang Aktif (Sort Created Date: desc / asc)
GET {{baseUrl}}/branches?sortDirection=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Detail Kantor Cabang by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/branches/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Tambah Kantor Cabang Baru (Admin Only)
# @name createBranch
POST {{baseUrl}}/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provinceId": 1,
  "name": "Cabang Tangerang Selatan",
  "address": "Jl. Pahlawan Seribu No. 88, BSD City"
}

### 8. Update Kantor Cabang (Admin Only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/branches/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provinceId": 1,
  "name": "Cabang Bandung Barat",
  "address": "Jl. Soekarno Hatta No. 500, Bandung"
}

### 9. Soft Delete Kantor Cabang (Admin Only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/branches/4
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. Daftar Toko Whitelist Aktif
GET {{baseUrl}}/whitelist-stores
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 11. Tambah Toko ke Whitelist (Maksimal 50 Toko)
POST {{baseUrl}}/whitelist-stores
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeId": 2
}

### 12. Nonaktifkan Status Toko Whitelist
PUT {{baseUrl}}/whitelist-stores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### 13. Daftar Seluruh Audit Log
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 14. Filter Audit Log Berdasarkan Entity BRANCH
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs/entity/BRANCH?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
